                                                "sense_id": "3536fb44-950a-38b9-8279-e35551fff3b7",
                                                "text": "When the day came Nick turned up early at the bank and waited under a palm tree in the atrium. People hurried in, nodding to the commissionaire, who still wore a tailcoat and a top hat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
